:: Start {"position": "625,275", "size": "100,100"}
<h1>Welcome to Vascular Village!</h1><p>Meet Ruby, your guide on an amazing adventure inside the human body! 🔬</p><p>Follow Ruby as she explores the body's incredible systems, discovers how they work together, and learns the little things we can do every day to stay healthy.</p><p>From the heart pumping blood to the lungs bringing in oxygen, every discovery brings Ruby one step closer to understanding how our bodies keep us going!</p><p><strong>Are you ready to join Ruby and explore the wonders of Vascular Village?</strong></p>
<p class="back-link"> <<button "Let's Explore! →">><<goto "HomeScreen">><</button>></p>


/* MAIN HOME SCREEN  */
:: HomeScreen
<div class="home-screen">
    <h1>Vascular Village</h1>
    <p>Choose a part of your health journey!</p>
    <div class="body-map">
        <div class="body-circle head">
            [[🧠Brain->Brain]]
        </div>

        <div class="body-circle left">
            [[🩸Blood Cells->Blood Cells]]
        </div>

        <div class="body-circle center">
            [[❤️Heartbeat->Heart]]
        </div>

        <div class="body-circle right">
            [[🩸Blood Vessels->Blood Vessels]]
        </div>

        <div class="body-circle legs">
            [[🫁Lungs->Lungs]]
        </div>

    </div>
    
    <p class="home-hint">Tap a circle to begin exploring!</p>
</div>


/* FOR BLOOD VESSELS */

:: Blood Vessels
<div id="activity-menu"></div>
<<script>>
$(document).one(":passagedisplay", function () {
    setup.renderActivityMenu("bloodVessels", "activity-menu");
});
<</script>>

:: BloodVesselsActivity
<div id="activity-content"></div>
<<script>>
$(document).one(":passagedisplay", function () {
    var activityId = State.variables.selectedActivityId || "longPause";
    setup.renderActivity( "bloodVessels", activityId, "activity-content");
});
<</script>><p class="back-link"> <<button "← Return to Blood Vessels">> <<goto "Blood Vessels">> <</button>>
</p>



